Okay Hermes Voice

This project integrates with Hermes Agent by Nous Research:
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent

The default wakeword model path and threshold target H-Ali13381's Okay Hermes
RepCNN ONNX model repository:
https://github.com/H-Ali13381/okay-hermes-repcnn-onnx

No wakeword model weights are bundled in this repository. Users should download
model artifacts from their upstream source and follow the upstream license.
